  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Ta có elip <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>:</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math> được ghép bởi đồ thị của hai hàm số <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mi>a</mi></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mi>a</mi></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> trên đoạn <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/c5dad6d837c841157e173af1988d830ff77201daecd1c5135f46ea63b0270efe.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>\n\t\t Do tính đối xứng của hai hàm số trên qua trục <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên thể tích <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semanti